    <item>
      <title>ARIN Service Dependencies and Business Resilience</title>
      <link>https://www.arin.net/participate/community/acsp/suggestions/2025/2025-07/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 28 Oct 2025 09:25:00 -0400</pubDate>
      <guid>https://www.arin.net/participate/community/acsp/suggestions/2025/2025-07/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h3 id=&#34;arin-comment&#34;&gt;ARIN Comment&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;12 November 2025&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Thank you for your suggestion, numbered 2025.7 upon confirmed receipt, requesting that ARIN enhance documentation and procedures related to our core service dependencies, change management, and resilience practices. We recognize ARIN’s unique and critical role in Internet infrastructure and the importance of transparency and resilience for our customers’ operations.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;ARIN is developing a plan to document key service dependencies, clarify change-management practices, and outline our resilience and continuity objectives. Once finalized, we intend to present this work to the community for feedback and validation.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
