    <item>
      <title>Disable Option for Bulk ROA Removal Notifications</title>
      <link>https://www.arin.net/participate/community/acsp/suggestions/2025/2025-06/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 11 Jul 2025 09:25:00 -0400</pubDate>
      <guid>https://www.arin.net/participate/community/acsp/suggestions/2025/2025-06/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h3 id=&#34;arin-comment&#34;&gt;ARIN Comment&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;23 July 2025&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Thank you for your suggestion, numbered 2025.6 upon confirmed receipt, asking that ARIN add the ability to suppress the creation of email notifications for bulk ROA removals. We agree that this would be a beneficial feature, and we will be prioritizing it on our development calendar.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This suggestion will remain open pending implementation.  Thank you for participating in ARIN’s Consultation and Suggestion Process.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Regards,&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;American Registry for Internet Numbers (ARIN)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
