    <item>
      <title>ABQNOG</title>
      <link>https://www.arin.net/events/ABQNOG2026/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 24 Jun 2026 00:00:00 -0400</pubDate>
      <guid>https://www.arin.net/events/ABQNOG2026/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;ABQNOG is a technical conference centered on broadband and networking and run by networking professionals to help other networking professionals.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;ABQNOG was created to meet other people in the region that run networks, expand your personal network by meeting others in the region, and set up presentations on internetworking topics.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ARIN Customer Service Desk&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#xA;&lt;em&gt;Get Personalized Assistance from ARIN Staff&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Have questions about Internet number resources, ARIN membership and service agreements, or resource and routing security management tools? Our expert staff is ready to connect with you face-to-face and one-on-one at the ARIN Customer Service Desk to provide answers. The Customer Service Desk is your one-stop source for ARIN info and support, whether you’re:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>CANTO Annual Conference &amp; Trade Exhibition</title>
      <link>https://www.arin.net/events/CANTO41/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 24 Jun 2026 00:00:00 -0400</pubDate>
      <guid>https://www.arin.net/events/CANTO41/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;For 41 years, CANTO has led the Caribbean’s digital transformation, driving innovation, collaboration, and regional progress. This year, hosted at the Hard Rock Hotel &amp;amp; Casino Punta Cana in the Dominican Republic, this world-class venue sets the stage for strategic dialogue, high-level partnerships, and deeper regional unity. This setting allows leaders and innovators to engage meaningfully while experiencing one of the region’s most dynamic destinations.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Under the theme “Elevate the Caribbean — From Connectivity to Global Competitiveness,” the conference highlights how advanced digital infrastructure, innovation, and policy alignment can fuel inclusive growth and strengthen resilience. The program will explore the shifts needed to unlock new opportunities, empower communities, and increase the region’s influence on the global digital stage.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
